        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    An illustration, not a real fee. These mixes only show how Rs 1 lakh adds up.
  </p>

  <h2 id="skills">The eight skills, ordered by growth room</h2>

  <p>
    The first five can sell results to many clients and later grow into a team or a product, so they lead the list. The last three are capped by your hours until you add retainers or a small team, so each needs a business layer.
  </p>

