  <h2 id="stall">Skills that rarely reach lakhs alone</h2>

  <p>
    These are not useless. They are poor starting points if lakhs is the goal, because the pay ceiling is low and many people already offer them. Each can become a stepping stone when you add a specialty.
  </p>

  <div class="mistakes-list">
